// ~ALTERA_DATA0~	=>  Location: PIN_A4,	 I/O Standard: 2.5 V,	 Current Strength: Default
// ~ALTERA_ASDO~	=>  Location: PIN_B4,	 I/O Standard: 2.5 V,	 Current Strength: Default
